# Module:       Build / ESP-IDF defaults
#
# Purpose:      ESP-IDF build defaults for the bare ESP32-WROOM-32E (520 KB SRAM, 4 MB
#               flash, no PSRAM): Bluetooth off, 4 MB flash, the custom partition table,
#               lwIP socket and TCP keepalive settings, and log level.
#
# Targets:      ESP32-WROOM-32E (ESP-IDF 5.3.1) and the Linux host build
